    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet in an enviable and truly unrivalled location in Elly Bay, Belmullet, this beautifully presented detached residence enjoys magnificent dual-aspect views over the Atlantic Ocean, towards Achill Island and beyond.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this versatile property offers generous accommodation and an exceptional opportunity to acquire a home in one of Mayo's most sought-after coastal settings.\n\nAccommodation consists of four bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a main kitchen and living room featuring an attractive marble fireplace. In addition, there is a second kitchen/living area, utility room, main bathroom and separate shower room. The property is currently laid out as a 3 bed residence with a 1 bed self contained apartment. \n\nThe flexible layout makes the property particularly suitable for family living, multigenerational accommodation, guest use or those seeking additional independent living space, and provides considerable flexibility to accommodate a variety of living arrangements to suit the purchaser's individual needs.\n\nThe location is a major feature of this exceptional property, a stones' throw away from 2 stunning blue flag beaches, Elly Bay Beach to the front, and to the rear, Tailelaith Bay Beach. Residents can enjoy immediate access to the stunning coastline, with spectacular views and scenery extending across the Atlantic towards Achill Island and beyond. \n\nLocated within the Gaeltacht area, Elly Bay offers a peaceful and unspoilt coastal environment, while the nearby town of Belmullet provides a range of everyday amenities and services.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a double driveway, ample parking and open detached sheds, providing excellent storage and practical outdoor space.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial detached home in an exceptional coastal setting. The combination of its outstanding Atlantic views, proximity to the beaches, versatile accommodation, excellent condition and unrivalled location makes this property an ideal permanent residence, holiday home or investment opportunity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 5.14m x 0.97m\nTile floor.Coving.\n\nL-Shaped - 4.62m x 1.67m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.12m x 3.80m\nOak floor.Coving.Marble fireplace.Sea views.\n\nKitchen - 8.34m x 3.36m\nTiled floor.Shaker style oak kitchen.Fire surround with brick Stanley stove & back boiler.Coving.\n\nUtility Room - 2.06m x 1.76m\nTiled floor.Plumber for washer/dryer.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.13m x 3.29m\nSliderobes.Ensuite.\n\nEn Suite - 3.00m x 1.52m\nWalk in, fully tiled rainfall shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.43m x 2.98m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.28m x 2.76m\nSliderobes.Coving.\n\nBathroom - 3.39m x 1.66m\nFully tiled with jacuzzi bath.Separate double shower.Vanity unit.\n\n2nd Hallway - 3.17m x 0.76m\nTiled floor.\n\nT-Shaped - 3.88m x 0.92m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 3.37m x 5.41m\nIntegrated appliances.Tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.19m x 2.73m\nHerringbone floor.\n\nShower Room - 3.08m x 1.74m\nMira electric shower.Fully tiled.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Unrivalled coastal location in Elly Bay with stunning Atlantic and Achill Island views.</li><li> Four-bedroom detached home, currently arranged as a 3-bed residence with self-contained 1-bed apartment.</li><li> Flexible accommodation with master ensuite, two kitchen/living areas, utility, bathroom and shower room.</li><li> Minutes from two Blue Flag beaches Elly Bay Beach and Tailelaith Bay Beach.</li><li> Excellent condition, with double driveway, ample parking and detached sheds.</li><li> Ideal family home, holiday property or investment in a peaceful North Mayo setting.</ul>"
